msgid ""
"These pages state the contracts. They are meant to be searched and "
"consulted. Start with a tutorial when you need a first example."
msgstr ""
"Estas páginas describen los contratos y están pensadas para consultar y "
"buscar. Empiece por un tutorial si necesita un primer ejemplo."

#~| msgid ""
#~| "``register ID PATH`` runs the program once, after asking (``--yes`` "
#~| "answers), to read what it is, and pins its SHA-256. ``run`` and "
#~| "``publish`` check the pin before they start the program; a changed "
#~| "program must be registered again. ``unregister`` removes only the "
#~| "entry."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "``register ID PATH`` inspects the program after asking (``--yes`` "
#~ "answers), then pins its SHA-256. Build plugins also pass qualification "
#~ "before the entry is written; supply ``--project=DIR`` and "
#~ "``--config=FILE`` when their checks need configuration. ``run`` and "
#~ "``publish`` check the pin before starting the program; a changed "
#~ "program must be registered again. ``unregister`` removes only the "
#~ "entry."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``register ID PATH`` inspecciona el programa tras pedir confirmación "
#~ "(``--yes`` la acepta) y fija su SHA-256. Los plugins de compilación "
#~ "también deben superar las comprobaciones antes de guardar la entrada; "
#~ "indique ``--project=DIR`` y ``--config=FILE`` si necesitan "
#~ "configuración. ``run`` y ``publish`` verifican el checksum antes de "
#~ "iniciar el programa; si cambia, debe registrarlo de nuevo. "
#~ "``unregister`` elimina solo la entrada."

